We don't build assistants.\n                <br data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                <em class=\"text-[#111317]/42\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"italic emphasis text\">\n                    We build operators.\n                </em>\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"mt-20 grid gap-8 border-t border-[#111317]/14 pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-3\" data-name=\"footer info container\">\n                <p class=\"max-w-[450px] text-[18px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-[#111317]/58\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-3-1\" data-name=\"philosophy paragraph\">\n                    Assistants answer. Operators execute.\n                </p>\n                <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#111317]/38\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-3-2\" data-name=\"label text\">\n                    A different software primitive\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"bg-[#dfe3ea] px-8 py-28 md:px-20 lg:px-28\" data-kid=\"1-6\" data-name=\"architecture ladder section\" id=\"architecture\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1220px]\" data-kid=\"1-6-1\" data-name=\"architecture content container\">\n            <div class=\"mb-20 flex items-center gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1\" data-name=\"section index container\">\n                <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-[#111317]/45\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"section index label\">\n                    05 / The intelligence stack\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[#111317]/12\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"connector line\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid gap-4 border-t border-[#111317]/14\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2\" data-name=\"ladder step list\">\n                <div class=\"grid gap-4 border-b border-[#111317]/14 py-9 md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_1fr] md:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"ladder step row\">\n                    <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#5875c6]\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                        01 / Memory\n                    </span>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl font-light tracking-[-.05em]\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                        Memory\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[340px] text-[14px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-[#111317]/52\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                        Long-term context that keeps the operator close to your preferences.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-4 border-b border-[#111317]/14 py-9 md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_1fr] md:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"ladder step row\">\n                    <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#111317]/42\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                        02 / Intent\n                    </span>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl font-light tracking-[-.05em]\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                        Goals\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[340px] text-[14px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-[#111317]/52\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                        Human objectives translated into clear conditions for action.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-4 border-b border-[#111317]/14 py-9 md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_1fr] md:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3\" data-name=\"ladder step row\">\n                    <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#111317]/42\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                        03 / Reasoning\n                    </span>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl font-light tracking-[-.05em]\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                        Planning\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[340px] text-[14px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-[#111317]/52\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                        Complex tasks decomposed into sequences the runtime can carry out.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-4 border-b border-[#111317]/14 py-9 md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_1fr] md:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-4\" data-name=\"ladder step row\">\n                    <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#111317]/42\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                        04 / Agency\n                    </span>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl font-light tracking-[-.05em]\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                        Execution\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[340px] text-[14px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-[#111317]/52\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                        Direct interaction with browsers, APIs, and apps to finish the work.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-4 py-9 md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_1fr] md:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-5\" data-name=\"ladder step row\">\n                    <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#5875c6]\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                        05 / Continuity\n                    </span>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl font-light tracking-[-.05em]\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n   