atus label\">\n                            Active\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-16 text-[clamp(3.4rem,6vw,6.5rem)] font-light leading-[.9] tracking-[-.08em]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"operator headline\">\n                        Personal\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                        Brand.\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"mt-20 divide-y divide-[#111317]/12 border-t border-[#111317]/12\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"feature list container\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 py-4 text-[15px] text-[#111317]/72\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"feature item 1\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[#5875c6]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\">\n                                ✓\n                            </span>\n                            Writes and publishes\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 py-4 text-[15px] text-[#111317]/72\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"feature item 2\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[#5875c6]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\">\n                                ✓\n                            </span>\n                            Finds opportunities\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 py-4 text-[15px] text-[#111317]/72\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"feature item 3\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[#5875c6]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\">\n                                ✓\n                            </span>\n                            Learns your style\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"operator description container\">\n                    <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#5875c6]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"description label\">\n                        A runtime with a point of view\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-8 max-w-[560px] text-[clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5.6rem)] font-light leading-[.94] tracking-[-.07em]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"description headline\">\n                        Scale presence without the noise.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-9 max-w-[490px] text-[17px] font-light leading-[1.7] text-[#111317]/58\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"description body paragraph\">\n                        Operator 001 handles the work around your voice, audience, and opportunities so you can spend more time building what comes next.\n                    </p>\n                    <a class=\"collision-mono mt-12 inline-block border-b border-[#111317]/70 pb-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#111317]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"deploy button\" href=\"#deployment\">\n                        Deploy Operator 001\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-36 border-t border-[#111317]/14 pt-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3\" data-name=\"roadmap container\">\n                <div class=\"mb-12 flex items-end justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-1\" data-name=\"roadmap header\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"roadmap title container\">\n                        <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#111317]/42\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"roadmap label\">\n                            The roadmap\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-light tracking-[-.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"roadmap headline\">\n                            One runtime. Many operators.\n                        </h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#111317]/36\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"roadmap count label\">\n                        001 / 006\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2\" data-name=\"roadmap grid\">\n                    <div class=\"border border-[#111317]/50 bg-[#f7f8fa] p-7\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"roadmap phase 1 card\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.2em]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"phase status container\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"phase number label\">\n                                001\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#5875c6]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"phase status label\">\n                                Live\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"mt-14 text-2xl font-light\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"phase title\">\n                            Personal Brand\n                        </h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border border-dashed border-[#111317]/20 p-7 opacity-48\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"roadmap phase 2 card\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.2em]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"phase status container\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"phase number label\">\n                                002\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"phase status label\">\n                                Next\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"mt-14 text-2xl font-light\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"phase title\">\n                            Executive\n                        </h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border border-dashed border-[#111317]/20 p-7 opacity-48\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"roadmap phase 3 card\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.2em]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"phase status container\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"phase number label\">\n                                003\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"phase status label\">\n                                Next\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"mt-14 text-2xl font-light\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"phase title\">\n                            Research\n                        </h4>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"bg-[#dfe3ea] px-8 py-28 md:px-20 lg:px-28\" data-kid=\"1-8\" data-name=\"deployment process section\" id=\"deployment\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1220px]\" data-kid=\"1-8-1\" data-name=\"deployment content container\">\n            <div class=\"grid gap-20 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1\" data-name=\"deployment grid container\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-1\" data-name=\"deployment title container\">\n                    <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-[#111317]/45\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"deployment section header\">\n                        07 / Deployment\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-8 max-w-[440px] text-[clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5.6rem)] font-light leading-[.94] tracking-[-.07em]\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"deployment headline\">\n                        Built around how you already work.\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border-t border-[#111317]/16\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2\" data-name=\"deployment steps container\">\n                    <div class=\"grid gap-8 border-b border-[#111317]/16 py-8 md:grid-cols-4\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"process step 1\">\n                        <div class=\"collision-mono text-[10px] text-[#5875c6]\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step index number\">\n                            01\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"md:col-span-3\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"step content container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-light\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"step name\">\n                                Book a call\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] text-[#111317]/52\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                                We learn your workflow and identify where the runtime can create leverage.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid gap-8 border-b border-[#111317]/16 py-8 md:grid-cols-4\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"process step 2\">\n                        <div class=\"collision-mono text-[10px] text-[#111317]/42\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step index number\">\n                            02\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"md:col-span-3\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step content container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-light\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step name\">\n                                Deploy the runtime\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] text-[#111317]/52\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                                We connect the surfaces, goals, and context your operator needs.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid gap-8 py-8 md:grid-cols-4\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"process step 3\">\n                        <div class=\"collision-mono text-[10px] text-[#111317]/42\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"step index number\">\n                            03\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"md:col-span-3\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"step content container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-light\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"step name\">\n                                Operator goes live\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] text-[#111317]/52\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                                The system begins working, learning, and improving with you.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-28 border-t border-[#111317]/16 pt-8\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-2\" data-name=\"design partners container\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-2-1\" data-name=\"partners info container\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-8-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"partners header container\">\n                        <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#111317]/42\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"partners section header\">\n                            Design partners\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 max-w-[650px] text-4xl font-light tracking-[-.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"partners headline\">\n                            We're building this with our first design partners.\n                        </h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[280px] text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#111317]/52\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"partners description text\">\n                        Direct Slack. Weekly iterations. Custom deployments. Shape the roadmap.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"collision-dark px-8 py-32 md:px-20 lg:px-28\" data-kid=\"1-9\" data-name=\"manifesto section\" id=\"manifesto\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex min-h-[100dvh] w-full max-w-[1220px] flex-col justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-9-1\" data-name=\"manifesto content container\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/12 pb-6\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1\" data-name=\"manifesto header\">\n                <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-1\" data-name=\"manifesto section header\">\n                    08 / Manifesto\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/35\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-2\" data-name=\"event horizon label\">\n                    Event horizon\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"py-32\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2\" data-name=\"manifesto body container\">\n                <h2 class=\"max-w-[1060px] text-[clamp(3.5rem,8vw,9rem)] font-light leading-[.88] tracking-[-.08em]\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-1\" data-name=\"manifesto headline\">\n                    The internet changed.\n                    <br data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                    <span class=\"text-white/35\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"emphasized text\">\n                        Software didn't.\n                    </span>\n                    <br data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                    Until now.\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"mt-28 grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] md:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2\" data-name=\"manifesto footer text container\">\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[500px] text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.4vw,3.8rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-.06em] text-white/58\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"manifesto paragraph\">\n                        The next generation won't click.\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"paragraph line break\"/>\n                        <em class=\"text-white\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"italic emphasis text\">\n                            It will act.\n                        </em>\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[300px] text-[18px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-white/48\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"manifesto summary paragraph\">\n                        Collision is building AI operators for people who want to spend less time operating and more time building.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-t border-white/12 pt-28\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3\" data-name=\"final cta container\" id=\"final-cta\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-12 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-1\" data-name=\"cta content container\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"cta title container\">\n                        <span class=\"collision-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/42\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"cta section label\">\n                            Ready when you are\n                        </span>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-8 max-w-[700px] text-[clamp(3.2rem,7vw,7rem)] font-light leading-[.9] tracking-[-.08em]\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"cta headline\">\n                            Ready to deploy your first operator?\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"collision-mono inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center border border-white/30 px-7 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"cta button link\" href=\"#hero\">\n                        Book a deployment call\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <footer class=\"mt-28 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 border-t border-white/12 pt-6 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-white/35 md:flex-row\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2\" data-name=\"manifesto footer\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"footer runtime label\">\n                        Collision / Runtime 001\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"footer navigation links\">\n                        Vision    Manifesto    LinkedIn\n                    </span>\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-04T17:26:46.019765+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-04T17:37:12.676231+00:00",
      "id": "var_d60cff287751",
      "overrides": {
        "htmlAttrs": " lang=\"en\"",
        "bodyAttrs": " class=\"antialiased\"",
        "head": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Collision — Event Horizon</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/MotionPathPlugin.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/TextPlugin.min.js\"></script>\n    <script type=\"module\">\n        import Lenis from \"https://esm.sh/lenis@1\"\n        const lenis = new Lenis({\n            lerp: 0.1,\n            wheelMultiplier: 1.2,\n            infinite: false,\n        });\n        function raf(time) {\n            lenis.raf(time);\n            requestAnimationFrame(raf);\n        }\n        requestAnimationFrame(raf);\n    </script>"
      },
      "viewportScrollY": 0
    },
    "var_f7971a54716a": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Collision — Deep Space Runtime",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 6160,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@200;300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@200;300;400;600&display=swap');\n\n    :root {\n        --color-bg: #070A0F;\n        --color-carbon: #111923;\n        --color-accent: #5578D9;\n        --color-text: #94A3B8;\n        --color-white: #FFFFFF;\n    }\n\n    body {\n        background-color: var(--color-bg);\n        color: var(--color-text);\n        font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;\n        margin: 0;\n        overflow-x: clip;\n    }\n\n    .font-manrope { font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; }\n    .font-mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", \"Courier New\", monospace; }\n\n    /* Custom Starfield Background */\n    .star-layer {\n        position: fixed;\n        inset: 0;\n        z-index: 0;\n        pointer-events: none;\n        opacity: 0.3;\n    }\n\n    .stars-small {\n        background-image: radial-gradient(1px 1px at 25% 25%, #fff, transparent),\n                          radial-gradient(1px 1px at 50% 10%, #fff, transparent),\n                          radial-gradient(1px 1px at 75% 75%, #fff, transparent),\n                          radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 10% 90%, #fff, transparent);\n        background-size: 400px 400px;\n    }\n\n    .stars-large {\n        background-image: radial-gradient(2px 2px at 15% 15%, #fff, transparent),\n                          radial-gradient(2px 2px at 85% 45%, #fff, transparent),\n                          radial-gradient(2px 2px at 45% 85%, #fff, transparent);\n        background-size: 600px 600px;\n    }\n\n    .gravitational-lens {\n        position: absolute;\n        width: 1200px;\n        height: 1200px;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        background: radial-gradient(circle at center, transparent 30%, rgba(11, 16, 24, 0.9) 60%, var(--color-bg) 100%);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(85, 120, 217, 0.1);\n        box-shadow: inset 0 0 100px rgba(85, 120, 217, 0.05);\n        pointer-events: none;\n    }\n\n    .font-source-sans { font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif; }\n\n    .orb-glow {\n        box-shadow: 0 0 20px 2px var(--color-accent), 0 0 40px 4px rgba(85, 120, 217, 0.3);\n    }\n\n    .line-draw {\n        stroke-dasharray: 1000;\n        stroke-dashoffset: 1000;\n    }\n\n    .glass-panel {\n        background: rgba(17, 25, 35, 0.6);\n        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n    }\n\n    .manifesto-line {\n        line-height: 1.1;\n        letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n    }\n\n    /* Fixed Progress Indicator */\n    .progress-bar {\n        position: fixed;\n        left: 40px;\n        top: 50%;\n        transform: translateY(-50%);\n        height: 200px;\n        width: 1px;\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n        z-index: 50;\n    }\n\n    .progress-fill {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 0%;\n        background: var(--color-accent);\n    }\n\n    /* Travelling Orb */\n    #collision-orb {\n        position: fixed;\n        width: 8px;\n        height: 8px;\n        background: var(--color-accent);\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        z-index: 100;\n        pointer-events: none;\n        top: 0;\n        left: 0;\n    }\n</style>\n<link data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"Tabler icon font stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<link data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"Lenis scroll library stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/lenis@1/dist/lenis.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<!-- Background Layers -->\n<div class=\"star-layer stars-small\" data-kid=\"3\" data-name=\"small star background layer\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"star-layer stars-large\" data-kid=\"4\" data-name=\"large star background layer\">\n</div>\n<!-- Progress Indicator -->\n<div class=\"progress-bar hidden lg:block\" data-kid=\"5\" data-name=\"progress indicator bar\">\n    <div class=\"progress-fill\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"5-1\" data-name=\"progress bar fill\" data-reason=\"height changed by scroll position script\" id=\"page-progress\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[8px] font-mono tracking-widest text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"5-2\" data-name=\"progress indicator label\">\n        FLOW\n    </div>\n</div>\n<!-- Travelling Orb -->\n<div class=\"orb-glow\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"6\" data-name=\"travelling collision orb\" data-reason=\"position and scale changed by scroll animation script\" id=\"collision-orb\">\n</div>\n<!-- Hero Section -->\n<section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between p-8 lg:p-20 overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"7\" data-name=\"hero section\" id=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"gravitational-lens top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-30\" data-kid=\"7-1\" data-name=\"gravitational lens background effect\">\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"flex justify-between items-start z-10\" data-kid=\"7-2\" data-name=\"hero navigation bar\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\" data-kid=\"7-2-1\" data-name=\"brand logo and status container\">\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope font-bold text-white tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"7-2-1-1\" data-name=\"brand name\">\n                COLLISION\n            </span>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"7-2-1-2\" data-name=\"runtime status indicator container\">\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse\" data-kid=\"7-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"status pulse dot\">\n                </span>\n                RUNTIME / 001\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:flex flex-col items-end gap-1 text-[10px] font-mono tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"7-2-2\" data-name=\"signal status text container\">\n            <span data-kid=\"7-2-2-1\" data-name=\"signal title\">\n                DEEP SPACE SIGNAL\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-accent\" data-kid=\"7-2-2-2\" data-name=\"signal connection status\">\n                CONNECTED / SECURE\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"z-10 max-w-5xl mt-24\" data-kid=\"7-3\" data-name=\"hero content container\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-7xl lg:text-[9.5rem] font-manrope font-medium text-white leading-[0.85] tracking-tight mb-12\" data-kid=\"7-3-1\" data-name=\"hero main headline\">\n            AI operators for\n            <br data-kid=\"7-3-1-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n            <span class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"7-3-1-2\" data-name=\"headline highlight span\">\n                ambitious people.\n                <svg class=\"absolute -bottom-4 left-0 w-full h-1\" data-kid=\"7-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"underline svg\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 800 4\">\n                    <path class=\"hero-underline\" d=\"M0 2H800\" stroke=\"var(--color-accent)\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 8\" stroke-width=\"0.5\">\n                    </path>\n                </svg>\n            </span>\n        </h1>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end gap-12 lg:gap-24\" data-kid=\"7-3-2\" data-name=\"hero body and actions container\">\n            <p class=\"text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-md font-source-sans leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"7-3-2-1\" data-name=\"hero description text\">\n                Every ambitious person will eventually have AI operators working on their behalf. We’re building them.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"7-3-2-2\" data-name=\"hero button group\">\n                <button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-white text-black font-manrope font-bold text-sm tracking-wide transition-all hover:bg-accent hover:text-white group\" data-kid=\"7-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"primary call-to-action button\">\n                    Deploy Collision\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right inline-block ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"7-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow-up-right icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <a class=\"text-sm font-manrope font-medium text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" data-kid=\"7-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"secondary vision link\" href=\"#\">\n                    Read Vision\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"z-10 flex justify-between items-end\" data-kid=\"7-4\" data-name=\"hero status bar\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-12\" data-kid=\"7-4-1\" data-name=\"status info group\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\" data-kid=\"7-4-1-1\" data-name=\"orbit status container\">\n                <span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"7-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"orbit status label\">\n                    Orbit Status\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 font-mono tracking-wider\" data-kid=\"7-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"orbit status value\">\n                    STABLE / LEO\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\" data-kid=\"7-4-1-2\" data-name=\"latency status container\">\n                <span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"7-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"latency status label\">\n                    Latency\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 font-mono tracking-wider\" data-kid=\"7-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"latency status value\">\n                    0.042 MS\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-accent/30\" data-kid=\"7-4-2\" data-name=\"orb docking point for hero\" id=\"orb-dock-hero\">\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Shift Section -->\n<section class=\"min-h-screen bg-carbon/20 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 relative overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"8\" data-name=\"shift section\" id=\"shift\">\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\" data-kid=\"8-1\" data-name=\"shift background container\">\n        <svg class=\"w-full h-full opacity-10\" data-kid=\"8-1-1\" data-name=\"shift background svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 1000 1000\">\n            <path d=\"M500 0 V1000\" id=\"shift-path\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" stroke-width=\"0.5\">\n            </path>\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"z-10 text-center space-y-32\" data-kid=\"8-2\" data-name=\"shift content center\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden w-full\" data-kid=\"8-2-1\" data-name=\"shift title container\">\n            <h2 class=\"shift-text text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-[clamp(6rem,12vw,14rem)] font-manrope font-extrabold text-white/5 tracking-tighter uppercase italic leading-none whitespace-nowrap\" data-kid=\"8-2-1-1\" data-name=\"first shift text\">\n                Software waits.\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"relative py-12\" data-kid=\"8-2-2\" data-name=\"shift line divider container\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent/20\" data-kid=\"8-2-2-1\" data-name=\"orb docking point for shift\" id=\"orb-dock-shift\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-px h-64 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-accent/30 to-transparent\" data-kid=\"8-2-2-2\" data-name=\"shift vertical line\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden w-full\" data-kid=\"8-2-3\" data-name=\"shift second title container\">\n            <h2 class=\"shift-text text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-[clamp(6rem,12vw,14rem)] font-manrope font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter uppercase leading-none whitespace-nowrap\" data-kid=\"8-2-3-1\" data-name=\"second shift text\">\n                Operators work.\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-20 max-w-xl text-center px-8\" data-kid=\"8-3\" data-name=\"shift bottom description container\">\n        <p class=\"text-2xl text-slate-400 font-manrope font-light leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"8-3-1\" data-name=\"shift bottom description text\">\n            The next generation of software won't wait for instructions.\n            <span class=\"text-white font-medium\" data-kid=\"8-3-1-1\" data-name=\"highlighted text span\">\n                It will execute.\n            </span>\n        </p>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Problem Timeline -->\n<section class=\"min-h-[150vh] flex flex-col items-center py-32 px-8 relative\" data-kid=\"9\" data-name=\"problem timeline section\" id=\"problem\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl w-full\" data-kid=\"9-1\" data-name=\"problem content container\">\n        <div class=\"mb-32 text-center lg:text-left\" data-kid=\"9-1-1\" data-name=\"problem header container\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xs font-mono tracking-[0.5em] text-accent mb-6 uppercase\" data-kid=\"9-1-1-1\" data-name=\"efficiency paradox label\">\n                The Efficiency Paradox\n            </h3>\n            <p class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-manrope font-medium text-white max-w-2xl leading-tight\" data-kid=\"9-1-1-2\" data-name=\"problem headline\">\n                Ambitious people spend their time\n                <span class=\"text-slate-500 italic\" data-kid=\"9-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"highlighted operating span\">\n                    operating\n                </span>\n                instead of building.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"relative pl-12 lg:pl-24\" data-kid=\"9-1-2\" data-name=\"problem steps timeline\">\n            <!-- Vertical Line -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[5.5px] lg:left-[5.5px] top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-slate-800/50\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-1\" data-name=\"timeline vertical line\">\n                <div class=\"problem-progress absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-0 bg-accent shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--color-accent)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"timeline progress bar\" data-reason=\"height changed by scroll position script\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Steps -->\n            <div class=\"space-y-48\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2\" data-name=\"problem steps list\">\n                <div class=\"problem-step relative flex items-center gap-12 group\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"first problem step\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[-6px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 ring-8 ring-[#070A0F] group-hover:bg-accent transition-colors z-10\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"first step bullet\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"pl-8\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"first step content\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 block mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"first step label\">\n                            Input\n                        </span>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-manrope font-medium text-slate-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"first step title\">\n                            You\n                        </h4>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"problem-step relative flex items-center gap-12 group\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"second problem step\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[-6px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 ring-8 ring-[#070A0F] group-hover:bg-accent transition-colors z-10\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"second step bullet\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"pl-8\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"second step content\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 block mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"second step label\">\n                            Context\n                        </span>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-manrope font-medium text-slate-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"second step title\">\n                            Write & Post\n                        </h4>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"problem-step relative flex items-center gap-12 group\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"third problem step\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[-6px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 ring-8 ring-[#070A0F] group-hover:bg-accent transition-colors z-10\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"third step bullet\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"pl-8\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"third step content\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 block mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"third step label\">\n                            Engagement\n                        </span>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-manrope font-medium text-slate-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"third step title\">\n                            Reply & DM\n                        </h4>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"problem-step relative flex items-center gap-12 group\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"fourth problem step\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[-6px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 ring-8 ring-[#070A0F] group-hover:bg-accent transition-colors z-10\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"fourth step bullet\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"pl-8\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"fourth step content\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 block mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"fourth step label\">\n                            Communication\n                        </span>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-manrope font-medium text-slate-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"fourth step title\">\n                            Email & Meetings\n                        </h4>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"problem-step relative flex items-center gap-12 group\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"fifth problem step\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-[-6px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 ring-8 ring-[#070A0F] group-hover:bg-accent transition-colors z-10\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"orb docking point for problem\" id=\"orb-dock-problem\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"pl-8\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"fifth step content\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 block mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"fifth step label\">\n                            Cycle\n                        </span>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-manrope font-medium text-slate-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"9-1-2-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"fifth step title\">\n                            Repeat\n                        </h4>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Collision Runtime Diagram -->\n<section class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-32 px-8 relative bg-carbon/10\" data-kid=\"10\" data-name=\"runtime diagram section\" id=\"runtime\">\n    <div class=\"mb-24 text-center z-10\" data-kid=\"10-1\" data-name=\"runtime header container\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-mono tracking-[0.5em] text-accent mb-6 uppercase\" data-kid=\"10-1-1\" data-name=\"unified intelligence label\">\n            Unified Intelligence\n        </h3>\n        <p class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-manrope font-medium text-white max-w-xl mx-auto leading-tight\" data-kid=\"10-1-2\" data-name=\"runtime headline\">\n            One runtime.\n            <br data-kid=\"10-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n            Endless agency.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-6xl aspect-[2/1] flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"10-2\" data-name=\"runtime diagram area\">\n        <!-- SVG Connections -->\n        <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" data-kid=\"10-2-1\" data-name=\"svg connections group\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewbox=\"0 0 1200 600\">\n            <g class=\"runtime-paths\">\n                <!-- Curved Paths -->\n                <path class=\"runtime-line\" d=\"M600 300 Q400 300 300 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(85, 120, 217, 0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                </path>\n                <path class=\"runtime-line\" d=\"M600 300 L600 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(85, 120, 217, 0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                </path>\n                <path class=\"runtime-line\" d=\"M600 300 Q800 300 900 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(85, 120, 217, 0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                </path>\n                <path class=\"runtime-line\" d=\"M300 150 Q600 500 600 500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                </path>\n                <path class=\"runtime-line\" d=\"M600 100 L600 500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                </path>\n                <path class=\"runtime-line\" d=\"M900 150 Q600 500 600 500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                </path>\n            </g>\n        </svg>\n        <!-- Central Hub -->\n        <div class=\"w-64 h-64 rounded-full glass-panel flex flex-col items-center justify-center z-20 shadow-[0_0_100px_rgba(85,120,217,0.15)] border border-accent/30 relative\" data-kid=\"10-2-2\" data-name=\"central engine hub\" id=\"runtime-center\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-accent/20\" data-kid=\"10-2-2-1\" data-name=\"orb docking point for runtime\" id=\"orb-dock-runtime\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full animate-[spin_20s_linear_infinite] border border-dashed border-accent/10\" data-kid=\"10-2-2-2\" data-name=\"spinning dash animation container\">\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-500 mb-3 uppercase\" data-kid=\"10-2-2-3\" data-name=\"engine label\">\n                Engine\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white tracking-tighter uppercase italic\" data-kid=\"10-2-2-4\" data-name=\"collision title\">\n                Collision\n            </span>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-4 text-[9px] font-mono text-accent\" data-kid=\"10-2-2-5\" data-name=\"engine status group\">\n                <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse\" data-kid=\"10-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"active pulse dot\">\n                </span>\n                ACTIVE STATE\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- External Nodes -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[10%] left-[20%] flex flex-col items-center gap-4 z-10 group\" data-kid=\"10-2-3\" data-name=\"linkedIn node container\">\n            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl glass-panel flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 group-hover:text-accent group-hover:border-accent/50 transition-all duration-500\" data-kid=\"10-2-3-1\" data-name=\"linkedIn icon container\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-brand-linkedin text-3xl\" data-kid=\"10-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"linkedIn icon\">\n                </i>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-600 uppercase group-hover:text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"10-2-3-2\" data-name=\"linkedIn node label\">\n                LinkedIn\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[-5%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 z-10 group\" data-kid=\"10-2-4\" data-name=\"mail node container\">\n            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl glass-panel flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 group-hover:text-accent group-hover:border-accent/50 transition-all duration-500\" data-kid=\"10-2-4-1\" data-name=\"mail icon container\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-mail text-3xl\" data-kid=\"10-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"mail icon\">\n                </i>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-600 uppercase group-hover:text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"10-2-4-2\" data-name=\"mail node label\">\n                Mail / DM\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[10%] right-[20%] flex flex-col items-center gap-4 z-10 group\" data-kid=\"10-2-5\" data-name=\"calendar node container\">\n            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl glass-panel flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 group-hover:text-accent group-hover:border-accent/50 transition-all duration-500\" data-kid=\"10-2-5-1\" data-name=\"calendar icon container\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-calendar text-3xl\" data-kid=\"10-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"calendar icon\">\n                </i>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-600 uppercase group-hover:text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"10-2-5-2\" data-name=\"calendar node label\">\n                Calendar\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Terminal Node -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-15%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-6 z-10\" data-kid=\"10-2-6\" data-name=\"recipient terminal node container\">\n            <div class=\"w-px h-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-accent/20 to-white/20\" data-kid=\"10-2-6-1\" data-name=\"connector line\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-white flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-black shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)]\" data-kid=\"10-2-6-2\" data-name=\"recipient node container\">\n                <span class=\"text-[8px] font-mono tracking-widest uppercase mb-1 opacity-60\" data-kid=\"10-2-6-2-1\" data-name=\"recipient label\">\n                    Recipient\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-sm font-manrope font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" data-kid=\"10-2-6-2-2\" data-name=\"recipient title\">\n                    YOU\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Philosophy Section -->\n<section class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 bg-white text-black z-20\" data-kid=\"11\" data-name=\"philosophy section\" id=\"philosophy\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl w-full\" data-kid=\"11-1\" data-name=\"philosophy content container\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-6xl lg:text-[9rem] font-manrope font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[0.85] mb-16\" data-kid=\"11-1-1\" data-name=\"philosophy main headline\">\n            We don’t build assistants.\n            <br data-kid=\"11-1-1-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n            <span class=\"text-accent italic\" data-kid=\"11-1-1-2\" data-name=\"operators emphasis\">\n                We build operators.\n            </span>\n        </h2>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-12 pt-16 border-t border-black/10\" data-kid=\"11-1-2\" data-name=\"philosophy comparison container\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-md\" data-kid=\"11-1-2-1\" data-name=\"assistants vs operators container\">\n                <p class=\"text-3xl font-manrope font-light leading-snug\" data-kid=\"11-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"philosophy comparison text\">\n                    Assistants answer.\n                    <br data-kid=\"11-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"comparison line break\"/>\n                    <span class=\"font-bold\" data-kid=\"11-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"execute emphasis\">\n                        Operators execute.\n                    </span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent/20\" data-kid=\"11-1-2-2\" data-name=\"orb docking point for philosophy\" id=\"orb-dock-philosophy\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans max-w-sm\" data-kid=\"11-1-2-3\" data-name=\"philosophy body description\">\n                Most AI tools add noise. Collision subtracts work. A paradigm shift from chat bubbles to actual results.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Runtime Architecture -->\n<section class=\"min-h-screen py-32 px-8 lg:px-20 relative bg-bg\" data-kid=\"12\" data-name=\"architecture section\" id=\"architecture\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-24\" data-kid=\"12-1\" data-name=\"architecture content container\">\n        <div class=\"lg:w-1/3 space-y-8 sticky top-32 h-fit\" data-kid=\"12-1-1\" data-name=\"architecture sidebar\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xs font-mono tracking-[0.5em] text-accent uppercase\" data-kid=\"12-1-1-1\" data-name=\"technical stack label\">\n                Technical Stack\n            </h3>\n            <h4 class=\"text-5xl font-manrope font-medium text-white leading-tight\" data-kid=\"12-1-1-2\" data-name=\"architecture headline\">\n                Anatomy of an\n                <br data-kid=\"12-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                Operator.\n            </h4>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"12-1-1-3\" data-name=\"architecture description\">\n                The Collision Runtime is a sovereign intelligence layer designed for high-stakes execution and verifiable accuracy.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lg:w-2/3\" data-kid=\"12-1-2\" data-name=\"architecture details container\">\n            <div class=\"relative pl-12 border-l border-slate-800/50 space-y-32\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1\" data-name=\"architecture items list\">\n                <div class=\"arch-item relative group\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"memory item\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -left-[54px] top-1 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 group-hover:bg-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"memory item bullet\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"memory content\">\n                        <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"memory title\">\n                            Memory\n                        </h5>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans max-w-lg\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"memory description\">\n                            Persistent state across sessions, learning context, and long-term user preferences. It doesn't just remember facts; it remembers goals.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"arch-item relative group\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"goals item\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -left-[54px] top-1 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 group-hover:bg-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"goals item bullet\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"goals content\">\n                        <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"goals title\">\n                            Goals & Planning\n                        </h5>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans max-w-lg\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"goals description\">\n                            Dynamic step decomposition and multi-agent coordination. Operators don't just \"try\"; they formulate a critical path to completion.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"arch-item relative group\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"execution item\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -left-[54px] top-1 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 group-hover:bg-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"execution item bullet\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"execution content\">\n                        <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"execution title\">\n                            Execution Layer\n                        </h5>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans max-w-lg\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"execution description\">\n                            Browser automation, API orchestration, and native app control. The physical interface through which the operator acts on the world.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"arch-item relative group\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"learning item\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -left-[54px] top-1 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 group-hover:bg-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"orb docking point for architecture\" id=\"orb-dock-arch\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"learning content\">\n                        <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"learning title\">\n                            Continuous Learning\n                        </h5>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans max-w-lg\" data-kid=\"12-1-2-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"learning description\">\n                            Self-correcting feedback loops. Every task completed makes the operator faster and more attuned to your personal style.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Operator 001 Card -->\n<section class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 bg-bg\" data-kid=\"13\" data-name=\"operator-001 section\" id=\"operator-001\">\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-24 py-24 border-y border-white/[0.03]\" data-kid=\"13-1\" data-name=\"operator-001 container\">\n        <div class=\"lg:w-1/2 space-y-12\" data-kid=\"13-1-1\" data-name=\"operator-001 details container\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-1\" data-name=\"operator header\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"instance status container\">\n                    <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent shadow-[0_0_8px_var(--color-accent)]\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"status pulse dot\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono tracking-[0.4em] text-accent uppercase\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"instance status text\">\n                        Production Instance\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-6xl lg:text-8xl font-manrope font-bold text-white tracking-tighter leading-none\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"operator headline\">\n                    Operator 001\n                    <br data-kid=\"13-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                    <span class=\"text-slate-600 italic\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"personal brand emphasis\">\n                        Personal Brand.\n                    </span>\n                </h3>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-2xl text-slate-400 font-source-sans max-w-lg leading-relaxed font-light\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-2\" data-name=\"operator description\">\n                Deploy your sovereign digital twin. 001 handles the entire engagement funnel while you reclaim your attention.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-12\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-3\" data-name=\"operator actions container\">\n                <button class=\"px-10 py-5 bg-white text-black font-manrope font-extrabold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase hover:bg-accent hover:text-white transition-all\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"configure button\">\n                    Configure Runtime\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"status container\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-accent/40\" data-kid=\"13-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"orb docking point for 001\" id=\"orb-dock-001\">\n                    </div>\n                    Status: Verified\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lg:w-1/2 w-full\" data-kid=\"13-1-2\" data-name=\"operator features container\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1\" data-name=\"operator feature grid\">\n                <div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between p-8 glass-panel border-white/[0.05] hover:border-accent/30 transition-all duration-500\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"content feature\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope text-white opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"feature label\">\n                        Original Content Engine\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-circle-check text-accent text-xl\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"feature check icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between p-8 glass-panel border-white/[0.05] hover:border-accent/30 transition-all duration-500\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"dispatch feature\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope text-white opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"feature label\">\n                        Cross-Platform Dispatch\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-circle-check text-accent text-xl\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"feature check icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between p-8 glass-panel border-white/[0.05] hover:border-accent/30 transition-all duration-500\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"engagement feature\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope text-white opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"feature label\">\n                        Autonomous Engagement\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-circle-check text-accent text-xl\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"feature check icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between p-8 glass-panel border-white/[0.05] hover:border-accent/30 transition-all duration-500\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"discovery feature\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope text-white opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"feature label\">\n                        Opportunity Discovery\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-circle-check text-accent text-xl\" data-kid=\"13-1-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"feature check icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Tomorrow Constellation -->\n<section class=\"min-h-screen py-32 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center relative overflow-hidden bg-bg\" data-kid=\"14\" data-name=\"tomorrow constellation section\" id=\"tomorrow\">\n    <div class=\"z-10 mb-32\" data-kid=\"14-1\" data-name=\"constellation header\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-mono tracking-[0.6em] text-accent mb-8 uppercase\" data-kid=\"14-1-1\" data-name=\"future agency label\">\n            Future Agency\n        </h3>\n        <h4 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-manrope font-medium text-white tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"14-1-2\" data-name=\"constellation headline\">\n            The Expansion Roadmap.\n        </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-6xl aspect-square lg:aspect-video flex items-center justify-center z-10\" data-kid=\"14-2\" data-name=\"constellation visual area\">\n        <!-- Center Active Node -->\n        <div class=\"group relative flex flex-col items-center\" data-kid=\"14-2-1\" data-name=\"active node container\">\n            <div class=\"w-48 h-48 rounded-full border border-accent/40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center glass-panel shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(85,120,217,0.15)] relative z-20 transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-1\" data-name=\"center node container\">\n                <span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-accent mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.4em]\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"active label\">\n                    Active\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope font-bold text-white tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"node ID\">\n                    001\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-1 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"node type\">\n                    Brand\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"absolute -bottom-2 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-1-4\" data-name=\"orb docking point for tomorrow\" id=\"orb-dock-tomorrow\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Radiating Orbital Nodes -->\n            <div class=\"absolute w-[400px] h-[400px] border border-white/[0.03] rounded-full top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 animate-[spin_60s_linear_infinite]\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-2\" data-name=\"first orbital ring\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-32 h-32 glass-panel rounded-full border border-white/5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center opacity-20 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"exec node\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[8px] font-mono text-slate-600 mb-1\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"node label\">\n                        002\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-manrope font-bold text-white tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"node title\">\n                        EXEC\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 w-32 h-32 glass-panel rounded-full border border-white/5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center opacity-20 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"research node\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[8px] font-mono text-slate-600 mb-1\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"node label\">\n                        004\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-manrope font-bold text-white tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"node title\">\n                        RESEARCH\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute w-[600px] h-[600px] border border-white/[0.02] rounded-full top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 animate-[spin_90s_linear_infinite_reverse]\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-3\" data-name=\"second orbital ring\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-0 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-32 h-32 glass-panel rounded-full border border-white/5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center opacity-10 hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"sales node\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[8px] font-mono text-slate-600 mb-1\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"node label\">\n                        003\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-manrope font-bold text-white tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"node title\">\n                        SALES\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 right-0 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-32 h-32 glass-panel rounded-full border border-white/5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center opacity-10 hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"hiring node\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[8px] font-mono text-slate-600 mb-1\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"node label\">\n                        005\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-manrope font-bold text-white tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"14-2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"node title\">\n                        HIRING\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Deployment Timeline (Horizontal) -->\n<section class=\"min-h-screen py-32 bg-carbon/5 flex flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"15\" data-name=\"deployment timeline section\" id=\"deployment\">\n    <div class=\"px-8 lg:px-20 mb-24\" data-kid=\"15-1\" data-name=\"deployment header\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-mono tracking-[0.5em] text-accent mb-8 uppercase\" data-kid=\"15-1-1\" data-name=\"deployment label\">\n            Deployment Process\n        </h3>\n        <h4 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-manrope font-medium text-white tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"15-1-2\" data-name=\"deployment headline\">\n            From Zero to Agentic.\n        </h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-12 px-8 lg:px-20 overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar py-12\" data-kid=\"15-2\" data-name=\"timeline steps container\">\n        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-80 space-y-8\" data-kid=\"15-2-1\" data-name=\"first deployment step\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"15-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step header container\">\n                <span class=\"w-10 h-px bg-accent\" data-kid=\"15-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"line separator\">\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-accent\" data-kid=\"15-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                    STEP 01\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"15-2-1-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                Book Call\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"15-2-1-3\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                Schedule a session with our deployment team to map your existing workflows.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-80 space-y-8 opacity-60\" data-kid=\"15-2-2\" data-name=\"second deployment step\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"15-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step header container\">\n                <span class=\"w-10 h-px bg-slate-800\" data-kid=\"15-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"line separator\">\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"15-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                    STEP 02\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"15-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                Workflow Map\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"15-2-2-3\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                We identify the high-leverage tasks suitable for operator delegation.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-80 space-y-8 opacity-60\" data-kid=\"15-2-3\" data-name=\"third deployment step\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"15-2-3-1\" data-name=\"step header container\">\n                <span class=\"w-10 h-px bg-slate-800\" data-kid=\"15-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"line separator\">\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"15-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                    STEP 03\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"15-2-3-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                Runtime Setup\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"15-2-3-3\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                Your sovereign Collision Runtime is provisioned on secure infrastructure.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-80 space-y-8 opacity-60\" data-kid=\"15-2-4\" data-name=\"fourth deployment step\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"15-2-4-1\" data-name=\"step header container\">\n                <span class=\"w-10 h-px bg-slate-800\" data-kid=\"15-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"line separator\">\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"15-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                    STEP 04\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"15-2-4-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                Training\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"15-2-4-3\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                Operator 001 learns your preferences and tone from past work history.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-80 space-y-8 opacity-60\" data-kid=\"15-2-5\" data-name=\"fifth deployment step\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"15-2-5-1\" data-name=\"step header container\">\n                <span class=\"w-10 h-px bg-slate-800\" data-kid=\"15-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"line separator\">\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"15-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                    STEP 05\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"15-2-5-2\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                Go Live\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"15-2-5-3\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                Operator starts executing. You gain back 15+ hours per week instantly.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-1 h-1\" data-kid=\"15-2-6\" data-name=\"orb docking point for deployment\" id=\"orb-dock-deployment\">\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Design Partners -->\n<section class=\"py-48 px-8 lg:px-20 bg-bg relative overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"16\" data-name=\"design partners section\" id=\"partners\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto border-t border-white/[0.05] pt-32\" data-kid=\"16-1\" data-name=\"partners content container\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-12 mb-32\" data-kid=\"16-1-1\" data-name=\"partners header\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl\" data-kid=\"16-1-1-1\" data-name=\"partners intro container\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-[11px] font-mono tracking-[0.5em] text-accent mb-8 uppercase\" data-kid=\"16-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"beta ecosystem label\">\n                    Beta Ecosystem\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"text-6xl lg:text-8xl font-manrope font-medium text-white tracking-tighter leading-none mb-8\" data-kid=\"16-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"partners headline\">\n                    Building with the\n                    <br data-kid=\"16-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                    <span class=\"text-slate-800 italic\" data-kid=\"16-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"visionaries emphasis\">\n                        visionaries.\n                    </span>\n                </h4>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end gap-3 text-right\" data-kid=\"16-1-1-2\" data-name=\"intake info container\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"16-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"slots info\">\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl font-manrope font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"16-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"slots count\">\n                        12 Slots\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-lock text-slate-700 text-2xl\" data-kid=\"16-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"lock icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"16-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"intake label\">\n                    Limited Intake Q3 2024\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-x-24 gap-y-16\" data-kid=\"16-1-2\" data-name=\"partners grid\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-8 group\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-1\" data-name=\"first partner feature\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-accent mt-1\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"feature index\">\n                    01\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"feature content\">\n                    <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">\n                        Direct Slack Connectivity\n                    </h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">\n                        Instant deployment path to our core engineering team. We don't just provide software; we provide a dedicated runtime team.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-8 group\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-2\" data-name=\"second partner feature\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-accent mt-1\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature index\">\n                    02\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature content\">\n                    <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">\n                        Weekly Strategic Sprints\n                    </h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">\n                        Collaborative roadmap definition. Our partners shape the very nature of the operators we deploy next.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-8 group\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-3\" data-name=\"third partner feature\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-accent mt-1\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"feature index\">\n                    03\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"feature content\">\n                    <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">\n                        Custom Infrastructure Integration\n                    </h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">\n                        Bespoke adapter layers for your specific enterprise stack, ensuring zero-friction agency across your internal tools.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-8 group\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-4\" data-name=\"fourth partner feature\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-accent mt-1\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"feature index\">\n                    04\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"feature content\">\n                    <h5 class=\"text-2xl font-manrope font-bold text-white group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">\n                        Priority Model Access\n                    </h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-source-sans leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"16-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">\n                        Early access to experimental reasoning models and advanced long-term memory architectures before public release.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-48 py-16 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-12 grayscale opacity-20 border-t border-white/[0.05]\" data-kid=\"16-1-3\" data-name=\"partner logos container\">\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter uppercase italic\" data-kid=\"16-1-3-1\" data-name=\"logo item hypergraph\">\n                Hypergraph\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter uppercase italic\" data-kid=\"16-1-3-2\" data-name=\"logo item linear\">\n                Linear\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter uppercase italic\" data-kid=\"16-1-3-3\" data-name=\"logo item framer\">\n                Framer\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter uppercase italic\" data-kid=\"16-1-3-4\" data-name=\"logo item notion\">\n                Notion\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-manrope font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter uppercase italic\" data-kid=\"16-1-3-5\" data-name=\"logo item vercel\">\n                Vercel\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-1 h-1\" data-kid=\"16-2\" data-name=\"orb docking point for partners\" id=\"orb-dock-partners\">\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Manifesto -->\n<section class=\"min-h-[200vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 bg-bg\" data-kid=\"17\" data-name=\"manifesto section\" id=\"manifesto\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-5xl w-full space-y-[20vh] text-center lg:text-left\" data-kid=\"17-1\" data-name=\"manifesto container\">\n        <h2 class=\"manifesto-line text-7xl lg:text-[9rem] font-manrope font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"17-1-1\" data-name=\"manifesto first line\">\n            The internet changed.\n            <br data-kid=\"17-1-1-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n            <span class=\"text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"17-1-1-2\" data-name=\"manifesto emphasis\">\n                Software didn’t.\n            </span>\n            <br data-kid=\"17-1-1-3\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n            Until now.\n        </h2>\n        <h2 class=\"manifesto-line text-7xl lg:text-[9rem] font-manrope font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"17-1-2\" data-name=\"manifesto second line\">\n            The next generation\n            <br data-kid=\"17-1-2-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n            <span class=\"text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"17-1-2-2\" data-name=\"manifesto emphasis\">\n                won’t click.\n            </span>\n            <br data-kid=\"17-1-2-3\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n            It will act.\n        </h2>\n        <h2 class=\"manifesto-line text-7xl lg:text-[9rem] font-manrope font-extrabold text-white tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"17-1-3\" data-name=\"manifesto third line\">\n            Collision is building\n            <br data-kid=\"17-1-3-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n            <span class=\"text-accent italic\" data-kid=\"17-1-3-2\" data-name=\"manifesto emphasis\">\n                AI operators.\n            </span>\n        </h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent/20\" data-kid=\"17-2\" data-name=\"orb docking point for manifesto\" id=\"orb-dock-manifesto\">\n    </div>\n</section>\n<!-- Final CTA -->\n<section class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 relative overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"18\" data-name=\"final cta section\" id=\"final-cta\">\n    <div class=\"gravitational-lens top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-20\" data-kid=\"18-1\" data-name=\"gravitational lens background\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"z-10 text-center max-w-3xl\" data-kid=\"18-2\" data-name=\"cta content container\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-6xl lg:text-8xl font-manrope font-bold text-white tracking-tighter mb-12\" data-kid=\"18-2-1\" data-name=\"cta headline\">\n            Ready to deploy your first operator?\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"18-2-2\" data-name=\"cta actions container\">\n            <button class=\"px-12 py-6 bg-accent text-white font-manrope font-extrabold text-xl tracking-tight transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(85,120,217,0.4)] group\" data-kid=\"18-2-2-1\" data-name=\"book call button\">\n                Book a Deployment Call\n                <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-right inline-block ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"18-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"chevron icon\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_20px_white]\" data-kid=\"18-2-2-2\" data-name=\"orb docking point for final\" id=\"orb-dock-final\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\" data-kid=\"18-2-2-3\" data-name=\"cta onboarding info\">\n                Currently onboarding a small number of design partners.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <footer class=\"absolute bottom-8 w-full px-8 flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8 text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"18-3\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n        <div class=\"flex gap-12\" data-kid=\"18-3-1\" data-name=\"footer left links\">\n            <a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"18-3-1-1\" data-name=\"vision link\" href=\"#\">\n                VISION\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"18-3-1-2\" data-name=\"manifesto link\" href=\"#\">\n                MANIFESTO\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"18-3-1-3\" data-name=\"careers link\" href=\"#\">\n                CAREERS\n            </a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-center opacity-30\" data-kid=\"18-3-2\" data-name=\"copyright text\">\n            © 2024 COLLISION SYSTEMS INC.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-12\" data-kid=\"18-3-3\" data-name=\"footer right links\">\n            <a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"18-3-3-1\" data-name=\"twitter link\" href=\"#\">\n                TWITTER / X\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"18-3-3-2\" data-name=\"linkedin link\" href=\"#\">\n                LINKEDIN\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</section>\n<!-- Scripts -->\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script type=\"module\">\n    import Lenis from \"https://esm.sh/lenis@1\"\n    \n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n    // Initialize Lenis\n    const lenis = new Lenis({\n        duration: 1.2,\n        easing: (t) => Math.min(1, 1.001 - Math.pow(2, -10 * t)),\n        smoothWheel: true,\n    });\n\n    function raf(time) {\n        lenis.raf(time);\n        requestAnimationFrame(raf);\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(raf);\n\n    // Page Progress\n    lenis.on('scroll', (e) => {\n        const progress = e.progress;\n        gsap.to('#page-progress', { height: `${progress * 100}%`, duration: 0.1 });\n    });\n\n    // Traveling Orb Logic\n    const orb = document.querySelector('#collision-orb');\n    \n    const dockTargets = [\n        '#orb-dock-hero',\n        '#orb-dock-shift',\n        '#orb-dock-problem',\n        '#orb-dock-runtime',\n        '#orb-dock-philosophy',\n        '#orb-dock-arch',\n        '#orb-dock-001',\n        '#orb-dock-tomorrow',\n        '#orb-dock-deployment',\n        '#orb-dock-partners',\n        '#orb-dock-manifesto',\n        '#orb-dock-final'\n    ];\n\n    const orbTimeline = gsap.timeline({\n        scrollTrigger: {\n            trigger: 'body',\n            start: 'top top',\n            end: 'bottom bottom',\n            scrub: 1.5,\n        }\n    });\n\n    // Set initial position\n    gsap.set(orb, { xPercent: -50, yPercent: -50 });\n\n    dockTargets.forEach((target, index) => {\n        const el = document.querySelector(target);\n        if (!el) return;\n\n        const nextEl = index < dockTargets.length - 1 ? document.querySelector(dockTargets[index + 1]) : null;\n        \n        // Move orb to the center of the target element\n        orbTimeline.to(orb, {\n            left: () => {\n                const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();\n                return rect.left + rect.width / 2;\n            },\n            top: () => {\n                const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();\n                return rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n            },\n            scale: target === '#orb-dock-final' ? 3 : 1,\n            ease: \"none\",\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: el,\n                start: \"top center\",\n                end: \"bottom center\",\n                scrub: true,\n            }\n        });\n    });\n\n    // Entrance Animations\n    gsap.from(\".hero-underline\", {\n        strokeDashoffset: 800,\n        duration: 2,\n        ease: \"power3.out\",\n        delay: 0.5\n    });\n\n    gsap.utils.toArray(\".shift-text\").forEach(text => {\n        gsap.from(text, {\n            y: 100,\n            opacity: 0,\n            duration: 1.2,\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: text,\n                start: \"top 90%\",\n                end: \"top 40%\",\n                scrub: true\n            }\n        });\n    });\n\n    gsap.from(\".problem-progress\", {\n        height: 0,\n        scrollTrigger: {\n            trigger: \"#problem\",\n            start: \"top 60%\",\n            end: \"bottom 80%\",\n            scrub: true\n        }\n    });\n\n    gsap.utils.toArray(\".problem-step\").forEach((step, i) => {\n        gsap.from(step, {\n            x: -20,\n            opacity: 0,\n            duration: 0.8,\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: step,\n                start: \"top 85%\",\n                toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n            }\n        });\n    });\n\n    // Manifest Text Reveal\n    gsap.utils.toArray(\".manifesto-line\").forEach(line => {\n        gsap.from(line, {\n            opacity: 0.05,\n            y: 50,\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: line,\n                start: \"top 80%\",\n                end: \"top 20%\",\n                scrub: true\n            }\n        });\n    });\n</script>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-04T17:26:46.015637+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-04T17:26:46.015637+00:00",
      "id": "var_f7971a54716a",
      "viewportScrollY": 13035
    },
    "var_6dcab914a0dc": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Collision — Lush Systems",
      "parentId": "var_d60cff287751",
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 1540,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 10867
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500&display=swap');\n\n  :root {\n    --black: #0a0a0a;\n    --black-soft: #121212;\n    --paper: #f4f1de;\n    --paper-deep: #e7e2c7;\n    --coral: #ff6b6b;\n    --cobalt: #4d4dff;\n    --cyan: #7fcaf2;\n    --yellow: #f7d774;\n    --ink-muted: #a8a59a;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n    background: var(--black);\n    color: var(--paper);\n    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .font-mono { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; }\n  .text-balance { text-wrap: balance; }\n  .paper-grid {\n    background-color: var(--paper);\n    background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10,10,10,.045) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10,10,10,.045) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 32px 32px;\n  }\n  .black-grid {\n    background-color: var(--black);\n    background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(244,241,222,.045) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(244,241,222,.045) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 40px 40px;\n  }\n  .collision-ring {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(77,77,255,.55);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    transform: rotate(-12deg);\n  }\n  .collision-ring-coral {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,107,107,.55);\n    border-radius: 42%;\n    transform: rotate(18deg);\n  }\n  .runtime-pulse { animation: runtime-pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  .status-pulse { animation: status-pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes runtime-pulse {\n    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(77,77,255,.25); }\n    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 14px rgba(77,77,255,0); }\n  }\n  @keyframes status-pulse {\n    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n    50% { opacity: .48; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .runtime-pulse, .status-pulse { animation: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[var(--black)]\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"Collision landing page\">\n    <nav class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 border-b border-white/10 bg-[rgba(10,10,10,.88)] backdrop-blur-md\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"navigation header\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"navigation bar container\">\n            <a aria-label=\"Collision home\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand identity logo link\" href=\"#top\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid h-8 w-8 rotate-45 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-[var(--paper)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand icon box\">\n                    <span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo core\">\n                    </span>\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"-ml-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em] sm:text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand name text\">\n                    COLLISION\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-white/65 md:flex\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"navigation menu links\">\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" href=\"#manifesto\">\n                    Manifesto\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" href=\"#runtime\">\n                    Runtime\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" href=\"#partners\">\n                    Partners\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"rounded-full bg-[var(--paper)] px-4 py-2 font-bold tracking-[.12em] text-[var(--black)] hover:bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4\" href=\"#deploy\">\n                    Deploy\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"rounded-full bg-[var(--paper)] px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[var(--black)] md:hidden\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"mobile deploy button\" href=\"#deploy\">\n                Deploy\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n    <main data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\" id=\"top\">\n        <section class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10 pt-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero section\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid min-h-[760px] max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.08fr_.92fr]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero content grid\">\n                <div class=\"black-grid relative flex flex-col justify-between px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-16\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero system terminal panel\">\n                    <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--cobalt)] sm:text-xs\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero terminal logs\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1-1\">\n                            [SYSTEM] COLLISION RUNTIME / ONLINE\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1-2\">\n                            [CORE] KERNEL_ACTIVE: 0x8821AF\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1-3\">\n                            [NETWORK] BROWSER_INSTANCE_READY\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1-4\">\n                            [OPERATOR] AGENT_001 / STANDBY\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 text-[var(--paper)]/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1-5\">\n                            > TARGET: SaaS founders in New York City\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[var(--paper)]/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1-6\">\n                            > STATUS: 42 leads identified. Syncing...\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-3xl pb-6 pt-20 lg:pb-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero headline content\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--coral)] sm:text-xs\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero status badge\">\n                            <span class=\"status-pulse h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2-1-1\">\n                            </span>\n                            The runtime for ambitious people\n                        </div>\n                        <h1 class=\"max-w-3xl text-[clamp(3.8rem,8vw,7rem)] font-bold leading-[.9] tracking-[-.065em] text-[var(--paper)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero main headline\">\n                            AI operators for ambitious people.\n                        </h1>\n                        <p class=\"mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75 sm:text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"hero description text\">\n                            The next generation won't click. It will act. Collision builds autonomous software workforces for people who value their time.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"hero call-to-action group\">\n                            <a class=\"rounded-full bg-[var(--paper)] px-7 py-4 font-bold text-[var(--black)] hover:bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2-4-1\" href=\"#deploy\">\n                                Deploy Collision\n                            </a>\n                            <a class=\"rounded-full border border-white/25 px-7 py-4 font-medium text-white hover:border-white/60 hover:bg-white/5\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2-4-2\" href=\"#manifesto\">\n                                Read the vision\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-white/35\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"hero footer metadata\">\n                        01 / 09   From prompts to outcomes\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-[-320px] top-1/2 hidden h-[560px] w-[560px] -translate-y-1/2 lg:block\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4\" data-name=\"hero collision visual artifact\">\n                        <div class=\"collision-ring absolute inset-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4-1\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"collision-ring-coral absolute inset-14\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4-2\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 grid h-28 w-28 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full border-8 border-[var(--black)] bg-[var(--paper)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4-3\">\n                            <span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 rotate-45 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-[var(--black)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4-3-1\">\n                                <span class=\"h-3 w-3 -rotate-45 rounded-full bg-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4-3-1-1\">\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"absolute left-8 top-16 rounded-full bg-[var(--paper)] px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[9px] text-[var(--black)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4-4\">\n                            OP_SYNC\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"absolute bottom-16 right-5 rounded-full bg-[var(--black)] px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[9px] text-[var(--paper)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4-5\">\n                            GOAL_MERGE\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"paper-grid relative flex min-h-[540px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden px-5 py-10 text-[var(--black)] sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-16\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero interactive task cards panel\">\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 ml-auto w-full max-w-md space-y-3 lg:pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero task highlight card\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-7 rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero input command label\">\n                            <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                Input command\n                            </div>\n                            <h2 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                Build a presence people remember.\n                            </h2>\n                            <div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1-3\">\n                                <span class=\"status-pulse h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-1-3-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                Collision detected\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"ml-auto w-[92%] rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold shadow-[5px_5px_0_var(--yellow)] sm:text-base\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"hero task highlight headline\">\n                            Ship the Series A deck\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"ml-auto w-[82%] rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold shadow-[5px_5px_0_var(--yellow)] sm:text-base\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"hero status indicator\">\n                            Hire lead engineer\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"ml-auto w-[74%] rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold shadow-[5px_5px_0_var(--yellow)] sm:text-base\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-4\">\n                            Draft product vision\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"ml-auto w-[66%] rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold shadow-[5px_5px_0_var(--yellow)] sm:text-base\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1-5\">\n                            Finalize LPO\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-16 flex items-end justify-between gap-6 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero task list container\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"hero task list label\">\n                            Human goals\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2-2\">\n                            Machine execution\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 h-24 w-24 rounded-full border border-black/10 sm:bottom-12 sm:right-12 sm:h-32 sm:w-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-3\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"shift section\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid min-h-[680px] max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"shift comparison grid\">\n                <div class=\"black-grid flex flex-col justify-center px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"left shift panel\">\n                    <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--cobalt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                        The obsolete\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-6 text-[clamp(4rem,8vw,7.5rem)] font-bold leading-[.9] tracking-[-.065em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"obsolete software headline\">\n                        Software\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                        waits.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-8 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/60 sm:text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3\">\n                        Waiting for you to click. Waiting for you to toggle. Waiting for you to work for it.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"paper-grid relative flex flex-col justify-center px-5 py-20 text-[var(--black)] sm:px-8 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"right shift panel\">\n                    <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                        The future\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-6 text-[clamp(4rem,8vw,7.5rem)] font-bold leading-[.9] tracking-[-.065em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-2\">\n                        Operators\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-1\"/>\n                        work.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-8 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-black/60 sm:text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3\">\n                        Active execution. Goal-oriented. A runtime that works for you, even when you aren't watching.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 hidden h-40 w-3 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rotate-12 rounded-full bg-[var(--coral)] shadow-[0_0_0_6px_var(--paper)] lg:block\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-[58%] hidden h-36 w-3 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -rotate-12 rounded-full bg-[var(--cobalt)] shadow-[0_0_0_6px_var(--paper)] lg:block\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"paper-grid px-5 py-20 text-[var(--black)] sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"problem section\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"problem content container\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-4xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"problem statement header\">\n                    <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1\">\n                        The problem\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(2.7rem,5vw,5.5rem)] font-bold leading-[.95] tracking-[-.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2\">\n                        Ambitious people spend their time operating instead of building.\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.05fr] lg:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"problem tasks and focal card grid\">\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"stacked task chips\">\n                        <div class=\"border border-black/10 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-1\">\n                            Schedule meeting\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-black/10 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-2\">\n                            Reply to Slack\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-black/10 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-3\">\n                            Update CRM\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-black/10 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-4\">\n                            Draft proposal\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-black/10 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-5\">\n                            Search LinkedIn\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-black/10 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-6\">\n                            Check email\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-black/10 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-7\">\n                            Find flights\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-black/10 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-8\">\n                            Post to X\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border border-black/10 bg-white p-4 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-9\">\n                            Verify data\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"black-grid p-8 text-[var(--paper)] sm:p-12 lg:p-16\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"collision focal point card\">\n                        <div class=\"h-1 w-16 bg-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-1\">\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.05em] sm:text-5xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-2\">\n                            The task collision.\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/65\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-3\">\n                            Linear workflows are colliding with human scale. You are the bottleneck in your own operation.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-10 border-t border-white/15 pt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[var(--yellow)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4\">\n                            Move from task management to goal execution\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"black-grid px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"runtime infrastructure section\" id=\"runtime\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\">\n                <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\">\n                    <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--cobalt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\">\n                        Core infrastructure\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-.07em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\">\n                        The Collision Runtime\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3\">\n                        One engine to rule digital execution. Integrated into your stack, controlled by your goals.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] lg:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <div class=\"grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--cyan)] text-sm font-bold text-[var(--black)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                IN\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.2em] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-2-1\">\n                                    LINKEDIN\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1-2-2\">\n                                    Outreach active\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2\">\n                            <div class=\"grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--coral)] text-sm font-bold text-[var(--black)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                ML\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.2em] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-2-1\">\n                                    GMAIL\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-2-2\">\n                                    Drafting reply\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative mx-auto grid h-48 w-48 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-[var(--cobalt)] text-center runtime-pulse sm:h-56 sm:w-56\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-white/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                Status\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                ACTIVE\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-[-16px] rounded-full border border-dashed border-[var(--cobalt)]/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1\">\n                            <div class=\"grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--yellow)] text-sm font-bold text-[var(--black)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                                CA\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                                <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.2em] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1-2-1\">\n                                    CALENDAR\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1-2-2\">\n                                    Optimizing schedule\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border-t border-dashed border-white/20 pt-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-white/45 lg:text-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-2\">\n                            Goal → plan → action → proof\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"paper-grid px-5 py-20 text-[var(--black)] sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" data-name=\"philosophy section\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr] lg:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--cobalt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-1\">\n                            The operating thesis\n                        </span>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-6 text-[clamp(4rem,9vw,9rem)] font-bold leading-[.84] tracking-[-.075em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"philosophy header section\">\n                            We don't build\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                            assistants.\n                        </h2>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(4rem,9vw,9rem)] font-bold leading-[.84] tracking-[-.075em] text-[var(--cobalt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"philosophy operator text\">\n                            We build\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-3-1\"/>\n                            operators.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-l-4 border-[var(--coral)] pl-6 lg:mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\">\n                        <p class=\"max-w-xl text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-1\">\n                            Assistants answer questions. Operators execute outcomes. We are building the runtime for the next digital workforce.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 border border-black/10 bg-white/55 p-5 font-mono text-xs leading-loose text-black/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-2\">\n                            [SYSTEM_PARADIGM: COLLISION]\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-2-1\"/>\n                            [STRATEGY: AUTONOMOUS_ACTION]\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-2-2\"/>\n                            [OWNERSHIP: HUMAN_GOALS]\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"black-grid px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" data-name=\"architecture section\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1\">\n                    <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-1\">\n                        Technical blueprint\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem)] font-bold leading-[.9] tracking-[-.07em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-2\">\n                        Layered intelligence.\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2\">\n                    <article class=\"bg-[var(--paper)] p-7 text-[var(--black)] sm:p-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-[var(--cobalt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-1\">\n                            01 / Memory system\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-.05em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-2\">\n                            Deep context engine\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-5 leading-relaxed text-black/65\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-3\">\n                            A persistent neural graph that retains your goals, history, and evolving preferences.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-black/10 pt-5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-loose text-black/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-4\">\n                            [LOAD] context://user_preferences_alpha\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-4-1\"/>\n                            [LOAD] history://project_manifesto_v2\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-4-2\"/>\n                            > Status: retrieval active.\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"bg-[var(--cobalt)] p-7 text-white sm:p-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2\">\n                        <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-white/65\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1\">\n                            02 / Logic layer\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-.05em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2\">\n                            Strategic planner\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-5 leading-relaxed text-white/75\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-3\">\n                            Decomposing complex objectives into autonomous sub-tasks across heterogeneous platforms.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-white/20 pt-5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-loose text-white/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-4\">\n                            > task.split(\"Build Series A Deck\")\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-4-1\"/>\n                            > subtasks: analysis, visualization, synthesis\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-4-2\"/>\n                            > Result: path verified.\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"bg-[var(--coral)] p-7 text-white sm:p-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3\">\n                        <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-white/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-1\">\n                            03 / Action interface\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-.05em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-2\">\n                            Direct execution\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-5 leading-relaxed text-white/80\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-3\">\n                            Native browser and API control. We don't just talk to software; we operate it directly.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-white/25 pt-5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-loose text-white/75\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-4\">\n                            > runtime.env(BROWSER_HEADLESS)\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-4-1\"/>\n                            > browser.navigate(\"linkedin.com\")\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-4-2\"/>\n                            > dom.act(\"find_people\", \"founders\")\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"paper-grid px-5 py-20 text-[var(--black)] sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-7\" data-name=\"operator dossier section\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 border-b border-black/10 pb-10 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"max-w-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--cobalt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-1\">\n                            Your operational fleet\n                        </span>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-.07em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-2\">\n                            The Operator Dossier.\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-black/60 sm:text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-3\">\n                            Your fleet of agents, visualized as active operational assets. Meet Operator 001.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-2 font-mono text-xs\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2\">\n                        <span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center border border-black/15 text-black/35\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2-1\">\n                            ←\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center bg-black text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2-2\">\n                            →\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr_1fr]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2\">\n                    <article class=\"border border-black/15 bg-white p-7 shadow-[6px_6px_0_var(--black)] sm:p-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <div class=\"grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--black)] text-2xl text-[var(--paper)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                <span class=\"rotate-45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-1-1\">\n                                    ◆\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-black px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.12em] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-2-1\">\n                                    OP-ID: 001-ALPHA\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-end gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-black/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-2-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"status-pulse h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1-2-2-1\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    System active\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-3xl font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-2\">\n                            Operator 001\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-lg italic text-black/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-3\">\n                            “Digital growth strategist”\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-black/10 pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-4\">\n                            <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-4-1\">\n                                Live objective\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-bold leading-snug\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-4-2\">\n                                Secure 5 meetings with Series A founders.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-5 border-t border-black/10 pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5-1\">\n                                <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5-1-1\">\n                                    Budget utilized\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-3 h-2 bg-black/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5-1-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-full w-2/3 bg-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5-1-2-1\">\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5-1-3\">\n                                    $64.20 / $100\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5-2\">\n                                <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"success probability label\">\n                                    Current confidence\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--cobalt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5-2-2\">\n                                    94.8%\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-5-2-3\" data-name=\"success probability description\">\n                                    Against the current objective\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"border border-dashed border-black/25 p-7 sm:p-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <div class=\"h-16 w-16 rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-black/5\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                ID: 002-BETA\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-2xl font-bold text-black/65\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-2\">\n                            Fleet manager\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 italic text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-3\">\n                            “Resource optimization”\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-12 h-2 bg-black/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-4\">\n                            <div class=\"h-full w-1/4 bg-black/25\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-4-1\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-5\">\n                            Awaiting activation\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"border border-dashed border-black/25 p-7 sm:p-9\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3-1\">\n                            <div class=\"h-16 w-16 rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-black/5\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                                ID: 003-GAMMA\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-2xl font-bold text-black/65\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3-2\">\n                            Synthesis engine\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 italic text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3-3\">\n                            “Cross-platform sync”\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-12 h-2 bg-black/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3-4\">\n                            <div class=\"h-full w-0 bg-black/25\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3-4-1\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-black/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3-5\">\n                            Awaiting activation\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"black-grid px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-8\" data-name=\"deployment and governance section\" id=\"partners\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr] lg:items-start\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1\">\n                <div class=\"border border-white/10 bg-[var(--black-soft)] p-7 sm:p-10 lg:p-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1\" data-name=\"deployment console\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-white/10 pb-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-1\">\n                        <span class=\"status-pulse h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-1-1\">\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-white/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-1-2\">\n                            Deployment matrix\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-9 space-y-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/20 font-mono text-[10px] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-1-1\">\n                                01\n                            </span>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-1-2\">\n                                <div class=\"text-xl font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                    Identify core goals\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.08em] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                    AGENT_READY: TRUE / PERMISSIONS: SYNC\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-2\">\n                            <span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/20 font-mono text-[10px] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-2-1\">\n                                02\n                            </span>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-2-2\">\n                                <div class=\"text-xl font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                    Map operational stack\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.08em] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                                    CONNECTING: GMAIL, LINKEDIN, CALENDAR\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-3\">\n                            <span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/20 font-mono text-[10px] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-3-1\">\n                                03\n                            </span>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-3-2\">\n                                <div class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-3-2-1\">\n                                    Set safety parameters\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.08em] text-white/35\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-3-2-2\">\n                                    WAITING FOR USER INPUT\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-5 border-l-2 border-[var(--coral)] pl-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-4\">\n                            <span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--coral)] font-mono text-[10px] text-[var(--black)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-4-1\">\n                                04\n                            </span>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-4-2\">\n                                <div class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-4-2-1\">\n                                    Initiate runtime collision\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.08em] text-[var(--yellow)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-4-2-2\">\n                                    SYSTEM_EXECUTING_SEQUENCE\n                                    <span class=\"status-pulse\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-1-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cursor blinker\" data-reason=\"cursor blinks by animation\">\n                                        _\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"lg:pt-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2\" data-name=\"governance block\" id=\"deploy\">\n                    <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--yellow)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-1\">\n                        Governance console\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-5 text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,5.8rem)] font-bold leading-[.9] tracking-[-.07em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-2\">\n                        Collaborative architecture.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-3\">\n                        Design partners receive priority runtime access and steer our operational roadmap. We build for your scale.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-10 space-y-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-1\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-1-1\">\n                                <div class=\"text-lg font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-1-1-1\">\n                                    Direct Slack sync\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-1-1-2\">\n                                    Instant engineering channel\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--cobalt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-1-2\">\n                                01\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-2\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-2-1\">\n                                <div class=\"text-lg font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-2-1-1\">\n                                    Weekly sprint board\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-2-1-2\">\n                                    Joint feature development\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-2-2\">\n                                02\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-3\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-3-1\">\n                                <div class=\"text-lg font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-3-1-1\">\n                                    Human approval keys\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-3-1-2\">\n                                    Autonomous safety protocol\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--yellow)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-8-1-2-4-3-2\">\n                                03\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"black-grid px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-9\" data-name=\"manifesto section\" id=\"manifesto\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7rem)] font-bold leading-[.86] tracking-[-.08em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-1\">\n                        The internet changed.\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-1-1\"/>\n                        <span class=\"text-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-1-2\">\n                            Software didn't.\n                        </span>\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-1-3\"/>\n                        Until now.\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-8 lg:pt-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-6 border-t border-white/15 pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-[var(--coral)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2-1-1\">\n                                01\n                            </span>\n                            <p class=\"max-w-2xl text-2xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2-1-2\">\n                                The next generation won't click. It will act.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-6 border-t border-white/15 pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2-2\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-[var(--cobalt)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2-2-1\">\n                                02\n                            </span>\n                            <p class=\"max-w-2xl text-2xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2-2-2\">\n                                Collision is building AI operators, not just chat interfaces.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-6 border-t border-white/15 pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2-3\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-[var(--yellow)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2-3-1\">\n                                03\n                            </span>\n                            <p class=\"max-w-2xl text-2xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-9-1-1-2-3-2\">\n                                Humanity builds. Machines operate. The future is here.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"paper-grid px-5 py-16 text-[var(--black)] sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-24\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer inner container\">\n            <div class=\"black-grid relative overflow-hidden p-8 text-center sm:p-14 lg:p-20\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"footer call-to-action block\">\n                <div class=\"absolute left-8 top-8 h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[var(--cobalt)] sm:left-12 sm:top-12\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[var(--coral)] sm:bottom-12 sm:right-12\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\">\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[var(--yellow)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3\">\n                    Design partners now onboarding\n                </span>\n                <h2 class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl text-[clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5.8rem)] font-bold leading-[.9] tracking-[-.07em] text-[var(--paper)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4\">\n                    Ready to deploy your first operator?\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/60\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-5\">\n                    Give your team the time to build what only humans can build.\n                </p>\n                <a class=\"mt-9 inline-flex rounded-full bg-[var(--paper)] px-7 py-4 font-bold text-[var(--black)] hover:bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-6\" data-name=\"footer call-to-action button\" href=\"mailto:hello@collision.systems\">\n                    Book a design partner call\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"mt-6 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-white/40\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-7\">\n                    Runtime initialized. Standby for deployment.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-black/10 pt-6 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-black/45 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"footer bottom row\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\">\n                    © 2024 Lush Systems / Collision\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\">\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-black\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1\" href=\"#manifesto\">\n                        Manifesto\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-black\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2\" href=\"#runtime\">\n                        Docs\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"hover:text-black\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3\" href=\"#partners\">\n                        Partners\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-04T17:46:58.671508+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-04T18:28:15.705486+00:00",
      "id": "var_6dcab914a0dc",
